{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Endless Coffee Update! (Survivors-like Roguelite)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Coffee is a massive free update for Astro Prospector, including a new mode with <strong>5 new weapons</strong>, <strong>200+ new upgrades</strong>, <strong>9 different ships</strong>, new enemies and <strong>a thousand ways to break the Universe</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/3cdaa1f8b2d551343b81be8d389b2b69.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/3cdaa1f8b2d551343b81be8d389b2b69.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/3cdaa1f8b2d551343b81be8d389b2b69.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your own ship, <strong>survive</strong> 21 Days and <strong>destroy</strong> the source of SpaceCorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/908115b78d323ba47d58fbec5dcb243c.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/908115b78d323ba47d58fbec5dcb243c.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/908115b78d323ba47d58fbec5dcb243c.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, <strong>go Endless</strong>, find <strong>powerful synergies</strong> and try to get as far as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/52cde0a68bc2555a3bb00ed8592c21ab.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/52cde0a68bc2555a3bb00ed8592c21ab.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/52cde0a68bc2555a3bb00ed8592c21ab.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Coffee Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New survivors-like, ship builder mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 21 Days and go Endless. Reach as far as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 9 different ships, each one with unique gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills by levelling up and winning with each ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >420+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hours of playtime, find clever combinations, break the Universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Story Mode (Incremental)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Prospector is an <strong>incremental bullet hell </strong>about mining cofferoids and fighting the evil SpaceCorp. <strong>Collect</strong> resources, <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship and <strong>become</strong> unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine cofferoids from SpaceCorp's fields and steal their AstroCoffee seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and upgrade the skill tree to increase your ship power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Machines will try to stop you. Dodge their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.poster.avif?t=1773569026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.webm?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.mp4?t=1773569026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense experience (~5.0hr playtime).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our server Discord, so you can stay tuned and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player discretion is advised!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cofferoid Acquaintance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503440/d03bea26fdd6bd74ea67cd72b8780566b935b18b.jpg"},{"name":"Cofferoid Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503440/7672b791405cf08edf8e930d739a71f73519764a.jpg"},{"name":"Cofferoid Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503440/076997537815a10242f98e3969c9c50bc77b3b5a.jpg"},{"name":"Yeah, you can destroy them too","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503440/7732c14bd89a6e4704a79b708bcaa8cf8623138a.jpg"},{"name":"SpaceCorp Hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503440/e247c4d0ba